  "title": "Neonode Announces Adjournment of Annual Meeting of Stockholders",
  "summary": "STOCKHOLM, SWEDEN, June 12, 2025 — Neonode Inc. (NASDAQ: NEON) (the “Company” or “Neonode”) announced today that its 2025 Annual Meeting of Stockholders (the “Annual Meeting”) was convened and adjourned without any business being conducted, due to a lack of the required quorum. The meeting was held",
